\b 
\li1 \w Nemuel|strong="H5241"\w*, \w Jamin|strong="H3226"\w*, \w Jarib|strong="H3402"\w*, \w Zerah|strong="H2226"\w*,\f + \fr 4:24 \fqa Zerah \ft is a variant of \fqa Zohar\ft ; see \ref Genesis 46:10|GEN 46:10\ref* and Exodus 6:15.\f* \w and Shaul|strong="H7586"\w*.
