\s1 Moving the Ark to Jerusalem
\p \v 25 \w So|strong="H1961"\w* \w David|strong="H1732"\w*, \w the elders|strong="H2205"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*, \w and the commanders|strong="H8269"\w* \w of thousands|strong="H505"\w* \w went|strong="H1980"\w* \w with rejoicing|strong="H8057"\w* \w to bring|strong="H5927"\w* \w the ark|strong="H727"\w* \w of the covenant|strong="H1285"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w from|strong="H4480"\w* \w the house|strong="H1004"\w* \w of Obed-edom|strong="H5654"\w*. \v 26 \w And because God|strong="H430"\w* \w helped|strong="H5826"\w* \w the Levites|strong="H3881"\w* \w who were carrying|strong="H5375"\w* \w the ark|strong="H727"\w* \w of the covenant|strong="H1285"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*, \w they sacrificed|strong="H2076"\w* \w seven|strong="H7651"\w* \w bulls|strong="H6499"\w* \w and seven|strong="H7651"\w* \w rams|strong="H352"\w*.
