\q2 \w His loving devotion|strong="H2617"\w*\f + \fr 16:34 \ft Forms of the Hebrew \fqa chesed \ft are translated here and in most cases throughout the Scriptures as \fqa loving devotion\ft ; the range of meaning includes \fqa love\ft , \fqa goodness\ft , \fqa kindness\ft , \fqa faithfulness\ft , and \fqa mercy\ft , as well as \fqa loyalty to a covenant\ft .\f* \w endures forever|strong="H5769"\w*.
